WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:05.098
Ten is a friendly number. A ten frame has ten boxes.

00:05.548 --> 00:10.424
Put seven counters in the frame. How many empty boxes are left?

00:10.874 --> 00:15.332
Three boxes are empty. So seven and three make ten.

00:15.782 --> 00:23.305
Look for the partner that makes ten. Six needs four. Eight needs two. Nine needs only one.

00:23.755 --> 00:30.478
Knowing your partners to ten makes adding quicker. Seven and three. Six and four.

00:30.478 --> 00:31.557
Nine and one.
